lass= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: What a resume should do is help you land an interview. Once you get that, it will, hopefully, land you the job. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: I get it. What you said on the e-mail made sense. My resume is too general. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Right. The first thing we need to work on is the layout. What you want to present is a clearly organized summary of your qualifications. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: What a friend had told me is that a resume gets scanned for 25 seconds. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: And if your resume is hard to read and poorly organized, you won't even get an interview. <br />", "id": 1}, {"time": "49000", "image": "engenn9le10ob02re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: So, formatting, uh?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: To begin, use a logical format and wide margins. Do use clean type and clear headings. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: Ok. I get it.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Then, you need to use bold and italic on areas that you want to catch the reader's eye. It is also important to use bullets to emphasize accomplishments.<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: What you are saying is that I should identify accomplishments rather than just job descriptions. Right?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Yes! Include a one line job description and then list your accomplishments. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: And how do I go about doing that?<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Use action verbs. Instead of saying you worked with customers, you could say you \u201ccemented relationship with customers\u201d. <br />", "id": 2}, {"time": "96000", "image": "engenn9le10ob02re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: I like the sound of that. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: It says here you \u201chelped employees\u201d. You could rewrite this as you \u201cempowered employees through shared decisions\u201d. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: Those are great. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: And don't write that you \u2018dealt with problems'... say \"I solved problems without increasing costs.\"<br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Adam</span>: Thanks, Kristi. You've been a great help. Let's grab a coffee. <br />\n<span class= \"strong\"> Kristi</span>: Your treat?<br />", "id": 3}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}]}]}